Apple frameworks
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The optional "system dictation" engine uses Apple's SpeechAnalyzer framework
(macOS 26+). It is proprietary to Apple, is not redistributed by this project,
and its language assets are managed entirely by macOS.
